mbstring: multibyte strings (encodings, conversion, case, regular
expressions with oniguruma of the package az).

The module mbstring of PHP 8.1 for php81 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20210902/mbstring.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d,
its headers in include/php81/php/ext/mbstring.
